EnergyCommunity.messageBroker

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Manages asynchronous, event-driven communication and messaging infrastructure for the distributed system.
- Decouples high-frequency telemetry event publishers (meters, sensors, simulated sources) from downstream consumers.
- Provides pub/sub messaging channels and event dispatching.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: ASYNCHRONOUS TRANSPORT BOUNDARY.
- Boundary Rule: Isolates event-driven transport mechanisms from business logic. Components interact via published event schemas and listener contracts, keeping producers and consumers independently deployable and decoupled.
